# Content Business Entities (Permanent)

## Law

Sellable **corporate content** entities (Projects, Team, Gallery, …) live in Nest `ContentModule`, are **PostgreSQL** tenant tables (`business_id` + soft-delete), and are gated server-side — never UI-only.

## Content locale / translations (ADR 015)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Default language | Canonical string columns = **`fa`** |
| Other locales | JSONB `translations` — MVP shape `{ "en": { "<field>": "…" } }` |
| Tables (MVP) | `projects`, `project_categories`, `team_members`, `branches`, `business_services`, `clients`, `certificates`, `timeline_events` |
| Resolve | `pickLocalized` — non-fa uses translation with **fallback to column** |
| Document | `documents.locale` + Mongo `DocumentBody.locale` drive PDF `dir`/`lang` and collection `?locale=` |
| Not here | UI chrome next-intl (`10-theme-and-i18n.mdc`); galleries/locations without translations in MVP |

## Projects / Portfolio (`module.projects`)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **`module.projects`** — sellable catalog module, **not** in `plan.core` `baseEntitlements` |
| Tables | `project_categories`, `projects` |
| Scope | Always filter `businessId`; soft-delete via `deleted_at` |
| Media | Optional `cover_media_id` + `media_ids` (JSON string[]) — ids must resolve to active `media_assets` same Business |
| Location | Optional FK `location_id` → `locations` (same `businessId`); null allowed |
| Flexible data | `fields` JSONB for per-vertical extras (strict allow unknown keys; size-capped in service) |
| Status | `draft` \| `published` \| `archived` |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/projects` (+ `/project-categories`) |
| Mutate + list | `EntitlementGuard` + `@RequireModule('module.projects')` |

## Content import Excel/CSV (Phase 03)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| MVP entity | **Projects** only — see ADR 019 |
| Entitlement | Same as Projects: `@RequireModule('module.projects')` + `@RequireWritable` |
| Table | PostgreSQL `import_jobs` (`business_id`, status, mapping/preview/result JSON) |
| Temp file | ObjectStorage `{businessId}/imports/{importId}/original.{csv\|xlsx}` |
| Flow | Upload → map columns → preview → transactional commit (valid rows) |
| Large files | BullMQ queue `import.content` when row count &gt; `IMPORT_SYNC_MAX_ROWS` |
| Limits | `IMPORT_MAX_BYTES`, `IMPORT_MAX_ROWS` (env) |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/imports/...` |
| Non-goal | Auto-create categories/locations; other entities until product unlocks |

## Team members + Branches (foundational Business Data)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **No separate sellable module** — mutate with `@RequireWritable`; list/get with membership (expired = read-only) |
| Consumers | Org Chart (`module.org_chart`) and Map (`module.map`) read these rows later — do not fork duplicate people/branch stores |
| Tables | `team_members`, `branches` |
| Team fields | `name`, `role_title`, `photo_media_id?`, `department?`, `sort_order`, optional `branch_id?`, optional `parent_member_id?` (reporting line for Org Chart), `fields` JSONB |
| Branch fields | `name`, address lines / city / province / postal / country, `phone?`, optional FK `location_id` → `locations`, `sort_order`, `fields` JSONB |
| Media | `photo_media_id` must resolve to active `media_assets` same Business |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/team-members`, `/api/businesses/:businessId/branches` |

## Locations (foundational shared geography)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **No separate sellable module** — list/get = membership; mutate = `@RequireWritable` |
| Consumers | Projects, Branches, and later Map (`module.map`) — **one** `locations` table; never duplicate lat/lng stores |
| Table | `locations` |
| Fields | `name`, `country`, `province`, `city`, `address`, required `lat`/`lng` (WGS84), soft-delete |
| Coordinates | `lat` ∈ [-90, 90], `lng` ∈ [-180, 180]; both required on create/update when set |
| FK consumers | `projects.location_id`, `branches.location_id` → `locations.id` (`ON DELETE SET NULL`) |
| Soft-delete | Soft-deleted locations cannot be newly linked; existing FKs may be cleared or left until consumer updates |
| Map | Map Engine (`module.map`, P02-T06) reads these rows for markers — never fork lat/lng |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/locations` |

## Map Engine (`module.map`)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **`module.map`** — sellable catalog module (already seeded); not in `plan.core` base |
| Config store | Map settings live in **document/template Mongo block props** (`type: map`) — not a parallel PG geography table |
| Markers | Resolve from `locations` (and optionally locations linked via branches/projects) filtered by `businessId` + optional country |
| Block | `map` in `BLOCK_REGISTRY` with `moduleCode: module.map`; props: center, zoom, markersSource, countryRestriction, showMarkers, heightPx |
| API | `GET /api/businesses/:businessId/map/markers` — `@RequireModule(module.map)` |
| Editor | Leaflet + OSM tiles for interactive preview only |
| PDF | Static map image (OSM static endpoint) embedded in export HTML — see `docs/adr/008-map-pdf-static.md` |
| Gates | Saving a document body that contains `map` blocks requires `module.map`; PDF export of such docs also asserts `module.map` |

## Services / Clients / Certificates (foundational Business Data)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **No separate sellable module** — list/get = membership; mutate = `@RequireWritable` |
| Rationale | Standard company-profile data for documents/templates (not a premium vertical like Projects) |
| Tables | `business_services`, `clients`, `certificates` |
| Service fields | `name`, `description`, optional `icon_media_id`, `sort_order`, `fields` JSONB |
| Client fields | `name`, optional `website`, optional `logo_media_id`, `sort_order`, `fields` JSONB |
| Certificate fields | `name`, `issuer`, optional `issued_at` / `expires_at`, optional `document_media_id` (scan/PDF), `sort_order`, `fields` JSONB |
| Media | Optional media ids must resolve to active `media_assets` same Business |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/services`, `/clients`, `/certificates` |

## Organization Chart (`module.org_chart`)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **`module.org_chart`** — sellable catalog module (seeded); not in `plan.core` base |
| People store | **Reuse** `team_members` — never fork a second people table |
| Reporting edge | `team_members.parent_member_id` → same-business `team_members.id` (`ON DELETE SET NULL`); cycle rejected in service |
| Tree API | `GET /api/businesses/:businessId/org-chart/tree` — `@RequireModule(module.org_chart)` |
| Parent edit | PATCH team member `parentMemberId` with `@RequireWritable` (foundational team mutate); org-chart UI may also expose parent form when module entitled |
| Block | `orgChart` in `BLOCK_REGISTRY` with `moduleCode: module.org_chart`; props: `layout` (`tree-vertical` \| `tree-horizontal`), optional `rootMemberId`, `showPhotos`, `heightPx` |
| Editor / PDF | HTML/CSS tree (vertical or horizontal flex); same markup for preview + Chromium PDF — no Leaflet-style separate raster |
| Gates | Saving / exporting documents that contain `orgChart` blocks asserts `module.org_chart` |

## Timeline (`module.timeline`)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **`module.timeline`** — sellable catalog module (seeded); not in `plan.core` base |
| Table | `timeline_events` (`business_id`, soft-delete) |
| Fields | `occurred_at`, `title`, `body`, optional `media_id` → `media_assets`, `sort_order`, `fields` JSONB |
| Scope | Always filter `businessId`; list ordered by `occurred_at` desc then `sort_order` |
| Block | `timeline` in `BLOCK_REGISTRY` with `moduleCode: module.timeline`; props: `layout` (`vertical` \| `alternating`), `limit`, `heightPx` |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/timeline-events` — `@RequireModule(module.timeline)` |
| Editor / PDF | HTML/CSS timeline (same markup) — see `docs/adr/010-timeline-html-pdf.md` |
| Gates | Saving / exporting documents that contain `timeline` blocks asserts `module.timeline` |

## Gallery (`module.gallery`)

| Concern | Rule |
| --- | --- |
| Entitlement | **`module.gallery`** — sellable catalog module, **not** in `plan.core` `baseEntitlements` |
| Tables | `galleries`, `gallery_items` |
| Gallery fields | `name`, `description`, `sort_order`, soft-delete |
| Item fields | `gallery_id`, `media_id` (active `media_assets` same Business), `caption`, `sort_order` |
| Scope | Always filter `businessId` on gallery **and** items; soft-delete both |
| Reorder | Mutating sort via explicit item id order (service rewrites `sort_order`) |
| Block | Document/template block type `gallery` with `moduleCode: module.gallery`; props `{ galleryId }` |
| API | `/api/businesses/:businessId/galleries` (+ `.../items`, reorder) |
| Mutate + list | `EntitlementGuard` + `@RequireModule('module.gallery')` |

## Forbidden

- Putting content rows on User without `businessId`
- Shipping Projects without `module.projects` gate
- Shipping Gallery without `module.gallery` gate
- Duplicating lat/lng or address geography outside `locations` for Map/Projects/Branches
- Duplicating team/branch tables inside Org Chart / Map modules
- Inventing sellable `module.services` / `module.clients` / `module.locations` without a product decision — Location default is foundational
- Storing gallery image binaries outside Media Library (items reference `media_id` only)
- Shipping Map markers without resolving through `locations` (T06)
- Shipping Org Chart people outside `team_members` / without `parent_member_id` reporting edges
- Shipping Timeline events without `module.timeline` gate or outside `timeline_events`
